damaged_code:
```rust
fn release_resource(counter: &AtomicUsize) {
    if counter.fetch_sub(1, Ordering::Relaxed) == 1 {
        // BUG: Fetch_sub is relaxed, memory access in cleanup 
        // can be reordered before fetch_sub decrement!
        unsafe { free_resource(); } 
    }
}
```

fix:
Use `Release` for decrement, and an `Acquire` fence for the reclamation path.
```rust
fn release_resource(counter: &AtomicUsize) {
    if counter.fetch_sub(1, Ordering::Release) == 1 {
        // Ensure subsequent operations see the release
        std::sync::atomic::fence(Ordering::Acquire);
        unsafe { free_resource(); }
    }
}
```
